{"sections":[{"slug":"Kleisli范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Kleisli范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Kleisli 范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<p>Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上万有的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">因而</span> Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴与单子上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> (Eilenberg–Moore <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即万有的</span> $T$-<span lang=\"zh\">左模</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对偶(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的地位</span>..</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $T$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong></strong>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kleisli范畴","text":"Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Kl}$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>,</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Kl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to TY$ (<span lang=\"zh\">注意到由</span> $T$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to TY$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于自由</span> $T$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的同态</span> $TX\\to TY$),</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Kl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to Y$, $Y\\to Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">的复合为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的如下复合</span>:$$\r\nX \\to TY \\to TTZ \\overset{\\mu}{\\to} TZ.\r\n$$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">右模</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一个单子</span> $T$. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathsf{Kl}$, <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $X$, <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $X\\to Y\\to TY$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> $T$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子上的代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>:\n<span lang=\"zh\">自然变换</span> $FT \\to F$ <span lang=\"zh\">在对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上即为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $\\mathrm{id}\\colon TX\\to TX$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">该右模结构是万有的</span> $T$-<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即任意</span> $T$-<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span> $G\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一地穿过</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Kl}$. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">右模结构</span> $G\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $\\mathsf{Kl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">出发的函子</span> $\\mathsf{Kl}\\to\\mathcal D$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}